sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor SharmaJi as Shopkeeper (Sharma Ji)
    participant UI as Web Dashboard
    participant API as FastAPI Gateway
    participant Finance as Finance Agent (Gatekeeper)
    participant Supervisor as Supervisor Agent
    participant LangGraph as LangGraph Engine
    participant DB as SQLite / PostgreSQL

    Note over SharmaJi,DB: SCENARIO 1: DEMO FAILURE & FAULT ISOLATION
    SharmaJi->>UI: Clicks "Demo Failure" Button
    UI->>API: POST /api/demo/trigger-failure
    API->>DB: Set Amul Butter (Cost: Rs 60.00, Sell: Rs 55.00)
    API->>Finance: validate_task_finance(TASK_PROMO_PROD003)
    Finance-->>API: REJECTED: Negative Gross Margin (-9.09%, -Rs 5.00/unit)
    API->>DB: Insert FailureRecord (UNRESOLVED, TASK_PROMO_PROD003)
    API->>DB: Insert AuditLog (FINANCIAL_GUARDRAIL_VIOLATION)
    API-->>UI: Return 200 OK (Failure Details & Auto-Nav to /failures)
    UI-->>SharmaJi: Displays Negative Margin Violation in Table

    Note over SharmaJi,DB: SCENARIO 2: GENUINE PRICE RECTIFICATION & REVALIDATION
    SharmaJi->>UI: Clicks "Rectify Price & Revalidate"
    UI->>SharmaJi: Displays Rectification Modal (Cost: Rs 60, Proposed Sell: Rs 68)
    SharmaJi->>UI: Clicks "Confirm & Revalidate"
    UI->>API: POST /api/failures/1/rectify (Cost: 60, Sell: 68)
    API->>Finance: Re-validate Proposed Price (Cost: 60, Sell: 68)
    Finance-->>API: VALIDATED: Positive Margin (+11.76%, Unit Profit: +Rs 8.00)
    API->>DB: Update Product (status: HEALTHY, sell: 68.00)
    API->>DB: Update FailureRecord (recovery_status: RESOLVED)
    API->>DB: Insert AuditLog (PRICE_RECTIFICATION_VALIDATED)
    API-->>UI: Return 200 OK (Resolved Status)
    UI-->>SharmaJi: Table row updates with green "Rectified" badge

    Note over SharmaJi,DB: SCENARIO 3: HUMAN APPROVAL & GRAPH RESUMPTION
    Supervisor->>LangGraph: High-Impact Promotional Campaign requires Sign-off
    LangGraph->>LangGraph: interrupt() - Checkpoint saved to checkpoints.db
    LangGraph->>DB: Insert ApprovalRecord (status: PENDING)
    UI->>API: GET /api/approvals/pending
    API-->>UI: Pending Approval Card Stack
    SharmaJi->>UI: Reviews Terms & Clicks "Approve"
    UI->>API: POST /api/approvals/{task_id}/approve
    API->>DB: Update ApprovalRecord (status: APPROVED)
    API->>DB: Insert AuditLog (HUMAN_APPROVAL_DECISION)
    API->>LangGraph: Command(resume={'action': 'APPROVE'})
    LangGraph->>LangGraph: Resume Thread & Execute Task
    API-->>UI: Return Workflow Resumed
    UI-->>SharmaJi: Execution History updates with live results
